# DEVDEPARTMENT machine-local runtime state — derived, rebuildable, NEVER tracked.
# Includes .devteam/atlas.db (ATLAS R2) and .devteam/runs/*.log (builder session
# transcripts). The transcripts are the load-bearing reason this is a whole-dir
# ignore rather than a file list: a dispatch log contains the verbatim builder
# prompt and output, so it carries permission-bypass tokens and API-key-shaped
# test fixtures as a matter of course. Untracked-but-not-ignored meant one
# `git add .` would have committed credential-shaped content (N4). Caught
# 2026-08-14 by infra/ci/secret-scan.mjs flagging .devteam/runs/.
.devteam/
.autopilot_state.json

# Python bytecode (DEVDEPARTMENT scripts/tests)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Node / TypeScript build outputs (ORCH-owned file — builders request entries via Progress_Note)
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
STOP
board/*
!board/index.html
backups/
.source-import/
